---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout title="投资的三个要义" eyebrow="简单，但不容易" narrow>
  <div class="pageCol">
    {/* 三个要义：三张卡片 */}
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="cardLabel">条件 01</div>
        <div class="cardTitle">好资产</div>
        <div class="cardDesc">基本面扎实，持续创造价值</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="cardLabel">条件 02</div>
        <div class="cardTitle">好的买入价格</div>
        <div class="cardDesc">低估区间进场，留足安全边际</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="cardLabel">条件 03</div>
        <div class="cardTitle">好的卖出价格</div>
        <div class="cardDesc">高估区间落袋，兑现并守住收益</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 转折：简单，但不容易 */}
    <div class="transition">
      <div class="transitionMark">但</div>
      <div class="transitionText">
        三个条件说起来都简单，难的是全都能做对 — 核心难点在于<span class="transitionEm">预测未来</span>。
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 为什么难：三条证据 */}
    <div class="evidenceList">
      <div class="evidenceItem">
        <div class="bulletNum">1</div>
        <p class="evidenceText">专家的判断也只基于当下 — 巴菲特看好苹果、可口可乐，段永平看好茅台、腾讯，今天确实是好资产，但未来的市场与基本面如何变化，无人可知。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="evidenceItem">
        <div class="bulletNum">2</div>
        <p class="evidenceText">连管理层自己都没把握 — 茅台董事长一边说“年轻人到了年纪自然会喝白酒”，一边又放下身段去跟 9.9 元的瑞幸咖啡联名。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="evidenceItem">
        <div class="bulletNum">3</div>
        <p class="evidenceText">信息不足时的预测，长期期望为负 — 没有内幕消息时赌球是负期望；散户在信息不充分下预测未来，与赌球并无差别。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- shared.layout: pageCol ---- */
  .pageCol {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* ---- shared.layout: grid3 ---- */
  .grid3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: card / cardLabel / cardTitle / cardDesc ---- */
  .card {
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cardLabel {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #999;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .cardTitle {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #111;
  }

  .cardDesc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: bulletNum ---- */
  .bulletNum {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 1.7rem;
    height: 1.7rem;
    background: #c0392b;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ---- page-specific: transition ---- */
  .transition {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .transitionMark {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #c0392b;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .transitionText {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .transitionEm {
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #c0392b;
  }

  /* ---- page-specific: evidence ---- */
  .evidenceList {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .evidenceItem {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .evidenceText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>